OL,5,G1100 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FMore than 60 thefts are reported
OL,7,     Fto Derbyshire Police every day. In
OL,8,     Fthis episode, following a rise in
OL,9,     Fthefts across the East Midlands,
OL,10,     Fofficers target organised gangs of
OL,11,     Fthieves.
OL,12,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FThis episode covers an alarming
OL,14,     Fsurge in burglary and car theft as
OL,15,     Fpolice units pursue a gang of
OL,16,     Fsuspected car thieves using fake
OL,17,     Fregistration plates to steal
OL,18,     Fhigh-powered vehicles.
